    {
      "id": "disabled-chat-lifecycle",
      "priority": "integration_preserve",
      "title": "--input none、relay 协商与 reload 不是仅 UI 开关",
      "candidate": "配置经 client/runtime/native Process/UI catalog/broker/device/relay 贯穿；none 不创建聊天 outbox 房间但保留控制通道，reload 继续等 ReloadCommit；saved attach 不启动 composer。未收到 relay disabled-chat ACK 会失败关闭。",
      "main": "增加协议启动、peer driver、原生 -- 分隔与保存会话/reload 的覆盖；本身没有候选 chat_io 或 disabled-chat 改动。",
      "risk": "仅移植 Options/隐藏 composer 会遗漏 RPC/catalog/relay/attach 的一致性；Process 同时涉及主线 agent driver 与候选 chat_enabled。",
      "owner_action": "保留 disabled_chat_keeps_the_outbox_and_advances_reload_without_queue_commands 的真实不丢草稿/队列边界，并与 main 的 foreground_reload_preserves_agent_selection_and_native_arguments_after_separator、foreground_local_reload_preserves_agent_and_socket_before_native_separator 一起覆盖。区分 --socket（local MCP HTTP）与 --input sock（聊天入口）。",
